====Usage notes====
* ''New York City'' refers to the entire city spanning all five boroughs since its consolidation in 1898. Prior to that the city was primarily on [[Manhattan]] Island. The city’s official name is {{m|en|New York}} but it is commonly referred to as ''New York City'' ({{m|en|NYC}}), the {{m|en|City of New York}}, or ''New York, New York'' (NY, NY), in order to distinguish it from the state of {{m|en|New York}}.

